    "value": {
      "0": "The iron bolts find their mark with a terrifying, singular focus that defies ordinary physics. This weapon carries the crushing force of the deep earth, turning every strike into a shattering blow. It is a relic of peerless potency, forged for a purpose far beyond mere hunting."
